Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: library for reading whole slide images (runtime)
 OpenSlide is a C library for reading whole slide image files (also known
 as virtual slides).
 .
 This package bundles libdicom, which has no system package on
 Debian/Ubuntu.

